      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you help me with a depreciation calc? I have a piece of equipment that cost $45,000. It has an estimated salvage value of $5,000 and a useful life of 8 years. I need to find the annual straight-line depreciation amount. Can you walk me through the steps?",
